  "status": "GREEN exact emitted mul_qm31 body mapped to current operation semantics and installed in scalar_factor callback; full factored helper and Weights::pair remain open",
  "scope": "Exact generated canonical_qm31, WideExact.mul_qm31 and free wrapper declarations match pinned raw Aeneas Funs. The current operation model is connected to retained current QM multiplication semantics, with successful-output canonicality/coordinate decode theorem. It is installed alongside exact current add and mul_m31 in the source-cut scalar_factor callback; successful scalar_factor outputs expose the P6 fold and final quarter multiplication. The P6 iterFold/Std implementation, full fold value, factored helper identity, Pair caller reachability/state/error order, adoption, and runtime gates remain open.",
